WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.122
CGRP pathway therapies explained.

2
00:00:03.572 --> 00:00:07.380
How CGRP-targeted treatments work and where they fit in the pathway.

3
00:00:07.830 --> 00:00:13.368
Treat early in the attack with an effective dose; combination with an antiemetic helps some patients.

4
00:00:13.818 --> 00:00:16.883
Consider prevention when attacks are frequent or disabling.

5
00:00:17.333 --> 00:00:21.118
Several drug classes and CGRP-targeted options are available.

6
00:00:21.568 --> 00:00:26.781
Irregular sleep, missed meals and dehydration are common triggers that patients can manage.
